# Copy to cloudflare.env (git-ignored): a Cloudflare API token for
# cert-manager's DNS-01 challenges, made from the "Edit zone DNS" template:
#   Permissions: Zone / DNS / Edit and Zone / Zone / Read
#   Zone resources: Include / Specific zone / <the hosts' domain>
# https://dash.cloudflare.com/profile/api-tokens
api-token=
